jespersen pronunciation library
-------------------------------

Every other narrated language is pronounced by jespersen, a text-to-phonemes
library dedicated to the public domain (CC0 1.0), compiled in.
https://github.com/Federiker/jespersen
Its language data comes from these sources, under their own licences:

- CMUdict (Carnegie Mellon University), for American English; its notice
  follows below.
- Moby Pronunciator II (Grady Ward), for English homographs: public domain.
- Danish and Swedish pronunciations from NST's lexicons, Språkbanken at the
  National Library of Norway (CC0).

